WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.450
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Welcome to the Futures Friends Training Academy.

2
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.180
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: I'm Ms. June, a teacher in our story world.

3
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:14.780
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Here, grown-ups learn how the friends work in the classroom.

4
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.590
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Let's meet the four friends.

5
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.620
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Each one owns two pillars of the whole-child day.

6
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:26.570
<v Booker>Booker: Hi! I'm Booker. I love to learn, even when it's tricky!

7
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.720
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Booker owns Learn and Smile.

8
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.960
<v Lumi>Lumi: I'm Lumi! I help everyone feel like they belong.

9
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.360
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Lumi owns Belong and Reset.

10
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.610
<v Zuri>Zuri: I'm Zuri! Let's explore and find out together!

11
00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.220
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Zuri owns Explore and Nourish.

12
00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:46.730
<v Bop>Bop: And I'm Bop! Move your body, grow your mind!

13
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:49.430
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Bop owns Move and Outside.

14
00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.690
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Our learning loop has six steps:

15
00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:56.860
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: watch, talk, do, move, explore, take home.

16
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.250
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Take home gives families a question and an activity to share.

17
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.550
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Use the friends as steady cues.

18
00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.940
<v Bop>Bop: Ready? Bop and go!

19
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.760
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: ...means time to move.

20
00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:12.070
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Lumi's Quiet Time invites everyone to slow down.

21
00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.350
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Next is the planned Level 1, Foundations:

22
00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:19.600
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: learning zones, health and safety, and daily routines.

23
00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.380
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Level 2 goes deeper into each friend's zone.

24
00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.240
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Episodes and courses are still in development,

25
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:31.270
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: and no course counts towards required training hours until it's approved.

26
00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.580
<v Ms. June>Ms. June: Small steps, big stories.
